Package: histPharm
Type: Package
Title: History-Conditioned Pharmacology for Sequential Drug Experiments
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Zhaiyue", family = "Xu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xzy1234560809@163.com")
Author: Zhaiyue Xu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zhaiyue Xu <xzy1234560809@163.com>
Description: Tools for reciprocal, sequence-resolved drug-response experiments.
    histPharm estimates treatment-history-conditioned incremental drug effects,
    reciprocal sequence asymmetry, absolute residual-burden differences,
    effect-space coordinates, uncertainty by biological-replicate bootstrap,
    post-washout durable fate, and state-versus-clock predictive performance.
    The package enforces explicit lower-limit-of-quantification handling,
    complete matched reciprocal grids, biological-replicate inference, and
    timing/plate metadata for experimentally matched sequential pharmacology.
